{"version":1,"key":"card:99","content":{"id":99,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dcd4afff-46d7-4ef2-9637-f4245848487a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ls"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令的作用是查看指定目录下包含的所有文件及目录。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"41aa34f3-d438-4782-a988-ae4e8d719954","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"13dce5a8-28c3-4a7b-b967-8f85d79716ba","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 查看当前目录包含的文件及目录\n~ » ls\nhello  hello.c  math","collabId":"df9c62b9-89f4-4ebb-8bc9-a46c4752c34e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"118a6757-921f-42f1-8bf3-34ba0e4894da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当前目录包含两个文件 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hello"},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hello.c"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和一个目录 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"math"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"9670c82b-da3c-4116-9287-16f9ff37b2de","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f8c963ad-7799-4ea5-9529-eada8f5abe1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ls"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令没有指定查看哪个目录的内容，默认就是查看当前所在目录(工作路径)包含的内容。"}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/ls"],"createTime":1689176481366,"updateTime":1745155290096,"linkedCards":[{"id":63,"target":{"key":"card:63","type":"card","id":63},"summary":"很多的命令都接收一个路径作为参数，例如 ls 命令可以接收一个路径，查看该路径下包含的文件及文件夹。路径可以分为两种，绝对路径和相对路径，我们知道 Linux 的系统是一个树型结构，树的根就是根目录，它包含一系列的目录，这些目录又包含了更多...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]},{"id":100,"target":{"key":"card:100","type":"card","id":100},"summary":"ls 不会显示隐藏的文件和目录，在 Linux 中，以 . 开头的文件名或目录名就认为是隐藏文件(夹)，如果需要查看隐藏内容，可以添加 -a 选项 # 查看当前目录包含的所有内容，包含隐藏目录 ~ » ls -a . .cache .loc...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]},{"id":101,"target":{"key":"card:101","type":"card","id":101},"summary":"ls 只能查看一个层级的内容，所以当前目录下的 math 目录下的文件是查看不了的，如果希望进一步查看所包含目录的里面的内容，那么可以通过 -R 选项做到这件事情 # 递归显示目录 ~ » ls -R .: hello hello.c ma...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]},{"id":102,"target":{"key":"card:102","type":"card","id":102},"summary":"如果希望显示有关文件更多的信息，例如文件权限，文件大小等等，我们可以添加 -l 选项显示更多信息 # 显示文件的详细信息 ~ » ls -l total 32 -rwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt 16696 Nov 9 16:10 hel...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]},{"id":104,"target":{"key":"card:104","type":"card","id":104},"summary":"有的时候我们可能不记得文件或目录的具体名称，这个时候我们可以使用元字符进行模糊匹配： ? ：表示任意一个字符 * ：表示零个或多个字符 ~ » ls hello hello.c hello.md math ~ » ls -l hello.*...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155290096}}